---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: chbench_q3"
---
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |  Sort: revenue DESC NULLS FIRST, oorder.o_entry_d ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |   Projection: order_line.ol_o_id, order_line.ol_w_id, order_line.ol_d_id, sum(order_line.ol_amount) AS revenue, oorder.o_entry_d                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[order_line.ol_o_id, order_line.ol_w_id, order_line.ol_d_id, oorder.o_entry_d]], aggr=[[sum(order_line.ol_amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |       Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_w_id = oorder.o_w_id AND order_line.ol_d_id = oorder.o_d_id AND order_line.ol_o_id = oorder.o_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |         Inner Join:  Filter: customer.c_id = oorder.o_c_id AND customer.c_w_id = oorder.o_w_id AND customer.c_d_id = oorder.o_d_id AND new_order.no_w_id = oorder.o_w_id AND new_order.no_d_id = oorder.o_d_id AND new_order.no_o_id = oorder.o_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |           Cross Join:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |             TableScan: customer projection=[c_id, c_d_id, c_w_id], full_filters=[customer.c_state LIKE Utf8("A%")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |             TableScan: new_order projection=[no_o_id, no_d_id, no_w_id]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |           TableScan: oorder projection=[o_id, o_d_id, o_w_id, o_c_id, o_entry_d], full_filters=[oorder.o_entry_d > Utf8("2007-01-02 00:00:00.000000")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |         TableScan: order_line projection=[ol_o_id, ol_d_id, ol_w_id, ol_amount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT "order_line"."ol_o_id", "order_line"."ol_w_id", "order_line"."ol_d_id", sum("order_line"."ol_amount") AS "revenue", "oorder"."o_entry_d" FROM "customer" INNER JOIN "new_order" ON "customer"."c_state" LIKE 'A%' INNER JOIN "oorder" ON ((((((("customer"."c_id" = "oorder"."o_c_id") AND ("customer"."c_w_id" = "oorder"."o_w_id")) AND ("customer"."c_d_id" = "oorder"."o_d_id")) AND ("new_order"."no_w_id" = "oorder"."o_w_id")) AND ("new_order"."no_d_id" = "oorder"."o_d_id")) AND ("new_order"."no_o_id" = "oorder"."o_id")) AND ("oorder"."o_entry_d" > '2007-01-02 00:00:00.000000')) INNER JOIN "order_line" ON ((("order_line"."ol_w_id" = "oorder"."o_w_id") AND ("order_line"."ol_d_id" = "oorder"."o_d_id")) AND ("order_line"."ol_o_id" = "oorder"."o_id")) GROUP BY "order_line"."ol_o_id", "order_line"."ol_w_id", "order_line"."ol_d_id", "oorder"."o_entry_d" ORDER BY "revenue" DESC NULLS FIRST, "oorder"."o_entry_d" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
